   "catch!": "bandit/26cc61d2f53e.ogg",
   "coin, and we all walk away smilin'.": "bandit/e015e1a4f9f2.ogg",
   "didn't need to say that, did you.": "bandit/1e1ae615ce88.ogg",
   "easy, friends. let's talk business.": "bandit/390de48daecc.ogg",
   "everybody down here's working an angle. what's yours?": "bandit/170946c32a01.ogg",
   "fine, i'm in. equal shares, yeah?": "bandit/6ae003862fee.ogg",
   "ha! funny one. i like you.": "bandit/c2d765e59ac9.ogg",
   "ha! now you're talking my language.": "bandit/ed11db330e35.ogg",
   "i've got a family! i don't. but i could!": "bandit/39b1030822bf.ogg",
